# NAVA Wallet

A security-focused digital wallet project.

## Goals
- Secure digital asset management
- Clear transaction records
- User-controlled private keys
- Transparent token allocation
- Protection of funds reserved for charitable purposes

## Security Principles
- Never store private keys in this repository.
- Test all smart contracts before deployment.
- Document all allocation and withdrawal rules.
- No charitable allocation is considered locked until enforced by a tested smart contract.

## Status
Development prototype. Not yet ready for production use.
